# ============================================================
#  Mekar — Godot 4.x
#  Aset biner di-host di Cloudflare R2 (bukan di Git).
#  Metadata Godot (.import / .uid) TETAP di Git karena menyimpan UID.
#  JANGAN hapus/ignore *.import dan *.uid — scene .tscn/.tres
#  mereferensikan aset lewat UID di dalam file .import.
# ============================================================

# --- Godot 4+ cache, import cache & export ---
.godot/
*.translation

# --- OS metadata ---
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db
desktop.ini
__MACOSX/
._*

# ============================================================
#  Aset biner -> ada di R2, jangan di-commit
# ============================================================
# Gambar
assets/**/*.png
assets/**/*.jpg
assets/**/*.jpeg
assets/**/*.webp
assets/**/*.svg
assets/**/*.bmp
assets/**/*.tga

# Audio
assets/**/*.mp3
assets/**/*.ogg
assets/**/*.wav

# Video
assets/**/*.mp4
assets/**/*.ogv
assets/**/*.webm

# Font
assets/**/*.ttf
assets/**/*.otf
assets/**/*.woff
assets/**/*.woff2

# 3D / model
assets/**/*.glb
assets/**/*.gltf
assets/**/*.blend
assets/**/*.fbx
assets/**/*.obj

# Arsip / source mentah
assets/**/*.zip

# ============================================================
#  PENGECUALIAN (urutan penting: harus di bawah pola di atas)
#  File .import & .uid WAJIB ikut Git -> menyimpan UID aset.
# ============================================================
!assets/**/*.import
!assets/**/*.uid

# --- Local tool state & dokumen internal (jangan di-commit) ---
assets.lock
assets.tar.gz
assets.sha256
docs/